# M6 mode 2 (shared save) with twelve virtual controllers: twelve views
# on one save; P1 clears 1level and every other map shows it at once.
# Screenshots of the twelve-view layout at 1920x1080 and 640x480, and
# the zoom.
size 1920x1080
# The first launch plays the intro: hold a key to skip it.
wait 150
hold enter 70
idle 400
solve
idle 900
key escape
key down 3
key enter
idle
key down 4
key enter
pads 12
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
pad 3 a
pad 4 a
pad 5 a
pad 6 a
pad 7 a
pad 8 a
pad 9 a
pad 10 a
pad 11 a
pad 12 a
pad 1 up 5
pad 1 right
expect state join SharedSave players=12
pad 1 a
pad 2 a
pad 3 a
pad 4 a
pad 5 a
pad 6 a
pad 7 a
pad 8 a
pad 9 a
pad 10 a
pad 11 a
pad 12 a
wait 50
expect state multi SharedSave players=12 views=12
idle
p2 walk 1level
p3 press up
p4 press right
p5 press up
p6 press pause
shot 01-shared-12-1080p
size 640x480
shot 02-shared-12-640x480
size 1920x1080
p6 press back
p1 walk 1level
p1 press wait
p1 idle
p1 solve
wait 10
p2 expect icon 1level 3
p7 expect icon 1level 3
p12 expect icon 1level 3
shot 03-shared-12-p1-won
p1 idle 900
pad 1 back
shot 04-shared-12-focus-p1
size 640x480
shot 05-shared-12-focus-640x480
size 1920x1080
pad 1 back
p1 press pause
p1 press down 3
p1 press wait
idle
expect state title
quit
